# Observability

PostHog event names (do not invent new ones without updating `docs/AGENTS.md`):

`scan_opened`, `qr_parsed`, `upi_app_selected`, `upi_launched`, `payment_returned`, `status_confirmed`, `transaction_recorded`.

Identify `userId` after auth. Prefer merchant name + amount. Do not dump raw QR if it may include extra PII. Never send PIN/OTP.

Sentry: Expo wrap + Express `errorHandler`. Scrub `Authorization`. No Datadog.

Keys stay in env. `EXPO_PUBLIC_*` is public; `JWT_SECRET` and `DATABASE_URL` are server-only.
